{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe fair weather has finally broken in Vienna. The air is heavy, and the city feels quite different under this grey sky. The Kleins left this morning, having spent their stay mostly at our table rather than wandering the sights. I suspect they find the effort of sightseeing too great for their taste, preferring the comfort of a good meal and conversation.\n\nI shall remain a few days longer. I want to see the places I have missed while the crowds are thinner and the light is softer. There is a certain melancholy in the evening here, but it suits my mood. I think of you and the boys in Berlin, wrapped in the familiar warmth of home. I hope Karl and Immanuel are studying well and that Ludwig is behaving himself.\n\nDo not worry about me. I am well, if a bit tired from the travel. I will write again soon.\n\nYour loving\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080383,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":191,"prompt_tokens":920,"total_tokens":1111,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-xaBWzLGoeSnqrstaGliBQLerRgeAGpYI","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":920,"prompt_ms":1064.687,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1572684782608695,"prompt_per_second":864.103722502482,"predicted_n":191,"predicted_ms":4674.614,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.603231578947366,"predicted_per_second":40.645067164903885}}